 "content": [
  {
   "text": "{\"explanations\":[{\"signal_id\":\"894492e1-ad86-4dbe-ba44-3b42237a9301\",\"explanation\":\"Runway has shortened every month, from {{fact:4e6971f5-1058-4866-a2e0-af324ac4d0dc}} months at July 31 to {{fact:9cb8edab-f0ed-47d3-a593-3052389e5299}} months at October 31. This points to sustained cash burn without fresh funding. It is the likely driver of the two covenant headroom signals, which show the same erosion against the runway and cash tests.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"233ec147-257f-4d3c-b851-7b15ad4ec1ff\",\"explanation\":\"This is the covenant view of the falling runway. Headroom has narrowed from {{fact:9e7601bb-0498-468a-bf82-c27e0f0ca1ac}} in August to {{fact:988eb01a-2ade-4939-b5a5-ae4ec33ab4dc}} in October, with runway at {{fact:03b5274b-ce22-44dc-a909-68cd4fb0797c}} months against a floor of {{fact:a3016cc7-c315-47bb-bba2-6eae70f903b9}}. It is still comfortably compliant, but the steady monthly decline matters if burn continues.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"5be3705b-c3b5-43f2-bc70-87298b4d3cd3\",\"explanation\":\"Unrestricted cash of {{fact:f294dc87-0da8-4b48-a408-60e6282f193e}} still clears the {{fact:c2893b24-aaa2-48eb-b939-7efd5860a9b2}} minimum. However, headroom fell from {{fact:2261870b-4c6e-44ea-8d02-6cc05227247b}} to {{fact:d743013d-09b0-4c4a-ac7d-0103574bf33d}} over two months and is now the thinner of the two covenants. It reflects the same cash burn behind the shrinking runway and may be the first test to tighten.\"}],\"ranking\":[\"894492e1-ad86-4dbe-ba44-3b42237a9301\",\"5be3705b-c3b5-43f2-bc70-87298b4d3cd3\",\"233ec147-257f-4d3c-b851-7b15ad4ec1ff\"]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
